# NOTICE

## Attribution

This project is a **fork** of an earlier community tracker. It would not exist
without the original work.

- **Original tracker:** created by **staticvacant** — <https://github.com/staticvacant/fnsprites>
- **This fork:** maintained by **Kreisler** (<https://github.com/itskreisler/fnsprites>)

The original tracker stopped being updated and is no longer being developed
against new Fortnite seasons, which left it unusable for anyone still tracking
sprites. This fork exists to keep that work alive: to continue maintaining it,
fix it, keep up with new seasons and codes, and keep it running for the people
who already rely on it. All credit for the original work goes to staticvacant.

Contributions in this fork: i18n (es/en/de), lost-sprites feature, branding,
image export rework, accessibility/QA fixes, Google Drive sync, deployment.

